 shift. With a small number of intentional changes and a handful of carefully chosen tools, you can dramatically reduce unnecessary data exposure, strengthen both your privacy and security. The goal is not perfection, but control, and keeping your life your own.https://api.fanfares.live/cdn/f36171b68d05573ca32e576ade2d83cef1c477c6418836f85ddf3c62692eb834.png\n⚡Zap 9999 sats to unlock this note on\nhttps://fanfares.io/naddr/naddr1qvzqqqqqqypzq0ug3j8lvaaqh0um9gake0qe2sj5kdry7kjrn3qv2km3c7gjg95lqyvhwumn8ghj7enpdenxzun9wvhxummnw3erztnrdaksqfphx5mnydpsvfjj6ve4xuuz6dpkxgez6wp3vgej6wpkv9nxgcfcxvmkxdehh5tl8n","created_at":1765262193,"id":"feaa30834edf96ed2f5f67e2d0ff893e534035ee414b90fd8fd3d7b7acba00d9","kind":1,"pubkey":"3f888c8ff677a0bbf9b2a3b6cbc1954254b3464f5a439c40c55b71c79124169f","sig":"5139117d06791fc7abeab0ed1f2e7d22d0f433f21896a78ddf3c5d0b268fe9dc0332eb0d2419cca2822d0f5073d545c67f2730a314f1fa80aabd14a74016b84a","tags":[["d","757240be-3578-4622-81b3-86afda837c77"],["encrypted","aes-256-gcm",""],["price","9999","SATS"],["referral","5000"],["a","31990:d7d8109ee43657ce6056ada4653006bbb641f31e50e85243681c2724507811ec:Fanfares","wss://fanfares.nostr1.com"],["client","Fanfares","31990:d7d8109ee43657ce6056ada4653006bbb641f31e50e85243681c2724507811ec:Fanfares","wss://fanfares.nostr1.com"],["X","e39bca10079570ad72b9d7f996cc9aa2e4ffaf8e097b3598f1f5ea1c4bff044d"],["zap","3f888c8ff677a0bbf9b2a3b6cbc1954254b3464f5a439c40c55b71c79124169f","wss://fanfares.nostr1.com","9999"]]}}